@startuml
title C2 — SO32 / CO32 Export complete availability
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
Staff -> System : exportAvailabilityCsv(destinationFile)
alt new writable destination; consistent representable data; write succeeds
  System --> Staff : absolute CSV path; exported slot-record count
else invalid/existing path, inconsistent data or write failure
  System --> Staff : export error; domain state unchanged
end
note over System
  Every slot, including BOOKED, is exported.
  Patient identity supports reconstructing occupied slots.
  An empty dataset produces a header-only CSV.
end note
@enduml
